    "body": "fix on issue/2611-voxel-stock-removal · PR #2644 · pinned by play_precalc_tests::the_playhead_waits_for_the_calculation_and_then_the_drawn_stock_shows_the_cut, stock_play_picture::the_drawn_stock_shows_the_removal_as_the_program_plays, stock_play_picture::the_drawn_stock_shows_the_removal_at_the_display_budget · merges when reviewed\n\nCause: the worker calculates the full stock removal before it shows a frame. During this time the transport clock continued, and the tool played over the uncut stock. The playhead now waits for the calculation.\n\nNot examined: the refusal path \"simulation shows the uncut stock: ...\". If you see that text on the status line, please comment here with the operation type.\n",
